{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`TECH`,`title`:`The Robot in the Garage`,`titleVN`:`Ch\u00fa robot trong ga-ra`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Viet`,`vn`:`Vi\u1ec7t, 14 tu\u1ed5i, m\u00ea robot, s\u1ed1ng \u1edf s\u1ed1 16`},{`name`:`Mi`,`vn`:`Mi, 11 tu\u1ed5i, em g\u00e1i Vi\u1ec7t, r\u1ea5t gi\u1ecfi t\u00ecm v\u00e0 s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i`},{`name`:`Mr Khai`,`vn`:`ch\u00fa Kh\u1ea3i, 45 tu\u1ed5i, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee7a hai anh em, th\u1ee3 \u0111i\u1ec7n`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A2`,`part`:2,`parts`:2,`title`:`The Missing Part`,`titleVN`:`Linh ki\u1ec7n c\u00f2n thi\u1ebfu`,`words`:`invent|invention|research|web|site|network|user|profile|engineer|researcher|link|print|printer|lab|physics|chemistry|biology|app|technology`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[The]] [[next]] [[day]], Viet [[and]] Mi [[carry]] [[the]] [[robot]] [[across]] [[the]] [[street]] [[to]] [[number]] 15. Mr Ba [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[it]] [[for]] [[a]] [[long]] [[time]]. [[He]] [[does|do]] [[not]] [[smile]]. \`[[Did|do]] [[you]] [[invent]] [[this]]?\` [[he]] [[asks|ask]]. \`[[Yes]],\` [[says|say]] Viet. \`[[It]] [[is|be]] [[our]] [[invention]].\``,`vn`:`H\u00f4m sau, Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 Mi khi\u00eang robot sang b\u00ean kia \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng, t\u1edbi s\u1ed1 15. Ch\u00fa Ba nh\u00ecn n\u00f3 h\u1ed3i l\u00e2u. Ch\u00fa kh\u00f4ng c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`C\u00e1c ch\u00e1u t\u1ef1 ch\u1ebf ra c\u00e1i n\u00e0y \u00e0?\` ch\u00fa h\u1ecfi. \`V\u00e2ng,\` Vi\u1ec7t n\u00f3i. \`\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u00e1t minh c\u1ee7a b\u1ecdn ch\u00e1u.\``},{`en`:`Mr Ba [[gives|give]] [[them]] [[a]] [[small]] [[engine]]. \`[[It]] [[is|be]] [[old]], [[but]] [[it]] [[works|work]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Bring]] [[the]] [[robot]] [[back]] [[when]] [[it]] [[walks|walk]].\` [[But]] [[the]] [[engine]] [[needs|need]] [[a]] [[special]] [[small]] [[part]], [[and]] [[nobody]] [[has|have]] [[one]].`,`vn`:`Ch\u00fa Ba \u0111\u01b0a cho hai anh em m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u01a1 nh\u1ecf. \`C\u0169, nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn ch\u1ea1y,\` ch\u00fa n\u00f3i. \`Bao gi\u1edd