stry]] [[teacher]] [[wants|want]] [[to]] [[know]] [[about]] [[the]] [[black]] [[smoke]]. [[The]] [[biology]] [[teacher]] [[asks|ask]], \`[[Does|do]] [[it]] [[eat]]?\``,`vn`:`\u1ede tr\u01b0\u1eddng, ba th\u1ea7y c\u00f4 \u0111\u1ebfn xem robot. C\u00f4 d\u1ea1y v\u1eadt l\u00fd m\u00ea chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u01a1. Th\u1ea7y d\u1ea1y h\u00f3a th\u00ec mu\u1ed1n bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 \u0111\u00e1m kh\u00f3i \u0111en. C\u00f2n th\u1ea7y d\u1ea1y sinh h\u1ecfi: \`N\u00f3 c\u00f3 \u0103n kh\u00f4ng?\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[printer]] [[works|work]] [[all]] [[afternoon]]. [[At]] [[six]] [[o'clock]], [[the]] [[part]] [[is|be]] [[ready]]. [[At]] [[home]], Mi [[opens|open]] [[the]] [[robot's|robot]] [[app]] [[on]] [[her]] [[phone]]. \`[[Let's|let]] [[test]] [[it]]!\` [[says|say]] Viet. [[The]] [[robot]] [[walks|walk]] [[across]] [[the]] [[room]] [[and]] [[brings|bring]] [[Dad]] [[a]] [[cup]] [[of]] [[tea]].`,`vn`:`Chi\u1ebfc m\u00e1y in ch\u1ea1y su\u1ed1t bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u. S\u00e1u gi\u1edd, linh ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u00e3 xong. V\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00e0, Mi m\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n robot tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. \`Th\u1eed n\u00e0o!\` Vi\u1ec7t n\u00f3i. Ch\u00fa robot \u0111i ngang qua ph\u00f2ng v\u00e0 b\u01b0ng cho b\u1ed1 m\u1ed9t c\u1ed1c tr\u00e0.`},{`en`:`[[Then]] Mi [[reads|read]] [[the]] [[list]] [[of]] [[teams|team]] [[on]] [[the]] [[school]] [[site]]. [[There]] [[are|be]] [[twenty]] [[robots|robot]]. [[One]] [[of]] [[them]] [[can]] [[talk]], [[dance]] [[and]] [[play]] [[football]]. \`[[Technology]] [[moves|move]] [[fast]],\` [[says|say]] [[Dad]].`,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i Mi \u0111\u1ecdc danh s\u00e1ch c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9i tr\u00ean trang web c\u1ee7a tr\u01b0\u1eddng. C\u00f3 hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ch\u00fa robot. M\u1ed9t trong s\u1ed1 \u0111\u00f3 bi\u1ebft n\u00f3i, bi\u1ebft nh\u1ea3y v\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111\u00e1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00f3ng. \`C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 \u0111i nhanh th\u1eadt,\` b\u1ed1 n\u00f3i.`}],`tease`:`Ch\u00fa robot b\u01b0ng tr\u00e0 c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 Mi c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i n\u00e0o tr\u01b0\u1edbc nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf?`}]}